    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.name
      value: Josephine
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: One of our clients is just ahead. It is very important that we don't
        physically interact with them while they are in the Twilight.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]
      value: If you accidentally touch them, it could shock them into attacking you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]
      value: As a dreamweaver, you have the ability to force them asleep so you can
        continue your work.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]
      value: All you have to do is shoot a tranquilizer ball at them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
