    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: fourthDialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondDialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: Did you just write on the wall? That's.... different. I like it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: thirdDialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: Did the police let them do it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: fourthDialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: No, they didn't. But I think that was part of the reason that they did
        it. To feel rebellious.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: fourthDialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondDialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: My grandfather told me that people used to do it all the time back then.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
